models.description:
Junction table connecting articles to multiple tags, enabling many-to-many relationship between articles and tags.

This table allows an article to have multiple tags while ensuring each tag-article association is unique.

Related to: {@link economic_political_discussion_board_articles}, {@link economic_political_discussion_board_tags}

